    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "```suggestion\r\n    exclude: /node_modules|algoliasearch-helper/,\r\n    extensions: ['.js', '.ts', '.tsx'],\r\n```\r\n\r\nthis works for me @dhayab, it leaves commonjs in place for the commonjs plugin, and doesn't add a bunch of babel plugins, essentially still using the helper as an external dependency.\r\n\r\n\r\nI'm surprised to why the change is only done in InstantSearch.js, probably needed for React InstantSearch Hooks, React InstantSearch Core and Vue InstantSearch too right?",
